cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this theme, please cite it as below."
title: "Darwin Theme: a dark, translucent desktop theme for KDE Plasma 6 and LXQt"
abstract: "A Mac-like desktop theme for KDE Plasma 6 and LXQt / Lubuntu with a top bar, a magnifying dock, a Spotlight-style search launcher, an Alt+Tab switcher, rounded windows, WhiteSur icons and the Inter font."
type: software
license: MIT
